"\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOctober 2026, around autumn, here is the Baden-Württemberg Ettlingen Big Flower Postcard.  \n\nA bird peeking out from the wall gazes quietly in profile.  \nIts large yellow and black beak takes center stage in the artwork.  \n\nI never expected an alley mural to feel so vividly alive.  \n\n\n\n\n"